  "question": {
    "text": "At a particular station, the TV transmission tower has a height of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. To triple its coverage range, height of the tower should be increased to",
